msgid "class mlib.common.dampedSpring.DampedSpring"
msgstr "class mlib.common.dampedSpring.DampedSpring"

msgid "再生履歴に依存しない、ベイク用の数値ソルバー。"
msgstr "A numerical solver for baking that does not depend on playback history."

