msgstr "Construction only validates the two references; it creates no curves or connections. Query connections each time, traversing unit-conversion nodes and blendWeighted input branches. This is not a general traversal through pairBlend, animation layers, or arbitrary computation nodes."

msgid "setKeyの数値は各アトリビュートの内部単位で受け取り、Mayaコマンド境界で UI単位へ変換する。AnimCurveのU型カーブに渡す無次元入力と混同しない。"
msgstr "setKey accepts numbers in each attribute's internal units and converts them to UI units at the Maya-command boundary. Do not confuse these values with the dimensionless input passed to an AnimCurve U-input curve."

