msgstr "Convert the processed count to an integer from 0 to scale."

msgid ":py:obj:`_track <mlib.common.progress._track>`\\ \\(iterable\\, line\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`_track <mlib.common.progress._track>`\\ \\(iterable\\, line\\)"

msgid "要素を順に返しながら、line の件数更新と描画を行うジェネレーター。"
msgstr "A generator that yields elements one by one, while updating the number of lines and redrawing."

msgid ":py:obj:`progressBar <mlib.common.progress.progressBar>`\\ \\(iterable\\, \\*\\[\\, label\\, total\\, width\\, ...\\]\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`progressBar <mlib.common.progress.progressBar>`\\ \\(iterable\\, \\*\\[\\, label\\, total\\, width\\, ...\\]\\)"

msgid "要素を同じ順序で返しながら、処理済み件数をテキスト1行へ描画する。"
msgstr "Yield elements in the same order while rendering the completed count on one line of text."

msgid "浮動小数点の丸め誤差で値が1つ小さくなるのを避けるため、整数演算で 切り捨てる。全体が0件の場合や、処理済み件数が全体に達した・超えた 場合は scale に揃える。"
msgstr "To avoid values being reduced by one due to floating-point rounding errors, truncate using integer arithmetic. When all items are zero or when the number of processed items has reached or exceeded the total, align with the scale."

msgid "処理済みの件数。"
msgstr "Number of processed items."

msgid "全体の件数。"
msgstr "Total count."

msgid "換算後の最大値。"
msgstr "Maximum value after conversion."

msgid "0 以上 scale 以下の整数。"
msgstr "An integer greater than or equal to 0 and less than or equal to scale."

msgid "最初の要素を取り出せた時点で0件の行を描画し、利用側が次の要素を 要求するたび(=直前の要素の処理が終わるたび)に1件進める。途中で ``break`` した場合や例外でジェネレーターが閉じられた場合も、描画に 着手していれば改行で行を閉じる。描画そのもの(出力や ``notify``)が 例外を送出した場合も同様で、書きかけの行を改行で閉じてから例外を 伝える。要素が1つも無ければ何も出力しない。"
msgstr "Once the first element is retrieved, render a blank line and advance by one element each time the consumer requests the next element (i.e., whenever the previous element has been processed). If ``break`` occurs or if the generator is closed due to an exception, close the line with a newline character if rendering has started. Similarly, if an exception is raised during the rendering itself (during output or ``notify``), close the incomplete line with a newline character before propagating the exception. If there are no elements, produce no output."

msgid "例外が伝わっている途中で行を閉じる場合、改行の書き込みに失敗しても その失敗は捨て、先に起きた例外をそのまま伝える(閉じられた出力先へ もう一度書こうとして別の例外に置き換わるのを防ぐ)。最後まで反復 できた場合の改行の失敗は、そのまま呼び出し側へ伝える。"
msgstr "When closing a line in the middle of exception propagation, even if writing a newline fails, that failure is discarded and the previously occurred exception is propagated as is (to prevent the replacement with another exception when attempting to write again to the closed output). If writing a newline fails only after successfully completing the iteration, that failure is propagated as is to the caller."

msgid "反復する対象。"
msgstr "Iterated target."

msgid "描画を担当する進捗行。"
msgstr "Progress bar that handles rendering."

msgid "*object* -- iterable の要素をそのまま返す。"
msgstr "*object* -- returns the elements of an iterable as-is."

msgid "引数検証とlen()は呼出し時に行い、要素の取出しと描画は反復時に行う。 最初の要素を取り出すと0件を表示し、次の要素を要求するたびに1件進む。 完走時に改行し、途中終了は返却ジェネレーターのclose()/回収時に行を閉じる。空入力では出力もnotifyもない。 入力反復・出力・通知の例外は伝播する。例外伝播/close時は改行の通常例外だけを抑制し、正常完了時は抑制しない。"
msgstr "Validate arguments and call len() immediately; fetch elements and render during iteration. Display zero completed items when fetching the first element, then advance by one whenever the next is requested. End with a newline on completion; after an early stop, close the line when the returned generator is closed or collected. Empty input produces neither output nor notifications. Propagate iteration, output and notification exceptions. During exception propagation or close, suppress only ordinary exceptions from the final newline; do not suppress them after normal completion."

msgid "要素をそのまま返す反復対象。"
msgstr "An iterable whose elements are returned unchanged."

msgid "行頭の見出し。末尾の空白を除き、空なら省略する。"
msgstr "The line prefix. Strip trailing whitespace and omit it if empty."

msgid "非負の全体件数。Noneはlen()を試し、TypeErrorなら件数のみを表示する。 実際の件数がtotalを超えてもバー/百分率は満杯のまま件数を増やす。"
msgstr "The nonnegative total count. None tries len(); on TypeError, display only the count. If the actual count exceeds total, keep the bar and percentage full while increasing the count."

msgid "バー幅。1以上。"
msgstr "The bar width, at least 1."

msgid "write/任意のflushを持つ出力先。Noneは呼出し時のsys.stdout。 行頭復帰を解釈しない出力先では描画が上書きされない場合がある。"
msgstr "An output destination with write and optionally flush. None uses sys.stdout at call time. Output may not overwrite the line if the destination does not interpret carriage returns."

msgid "各描画の文字列を同期で受け取る。改行/行頭復帰は含まない。 戻り値は無視し、必要な通知の間引きは呼出し側で行う。"
msgstr "Receive each rendered string synchronously, without a newline or carriage return. Ignore the result; callers must throttle notifications if needed."

msgid "元の要素を保持順に返すジェネレーター。"
msgstr "A generator yielding the original elements in retained order."

msgid "labelの型、width/totalの整数型が不正な場合。boolは整数指定として拒否する。"
msgstr "If label has an invalid type, or width/total is not an integer. Reject bool as an integer argument."

msgid "widthが1未満、またはtotalが負の場合。"
msgstr "If width is less than 1 or total is negative."

