msgstr "Value with unspecified digits and suffixes retained. Required intermediate digits are padded with 0."

msgid "整数でない値を指定した場合。"
msgstr "When a non-integer value is specified."

msgid "負の値を指定した場合。"
msgstr "When a negative value is specified."

