msgstr "Number at the end (single if same as the beginning)."

msgid "``prefix[start]`` または ``prefix[start:end]``。"
msgstr "``prefix[start]`` or ``prefix[start:end]``."

msgid "操作の標準単数型。"
msgstr "The standard single-component class for this operation."

msgid "単数・反復・シェイプが標準の実装ならTrue。"
msgstr "True if single components, iteration, and the shape use standard implementations."

msgid "Vertices/Vertexへの利用側の差替えを省略しなければTrue。"
msgstr "True if no user replacement on Vertices or Vertex would be bypassed."

msgid "シェイプ型が異なる場合。"
msgstr "When shape types are different."

msgid "トポロジー変更により番号が範囲外になった場合。"
msgstr "When the topology change causes the number to go out of range."

msgid "``maya.cmds`` へ多数の要素を渡す用途向け(``mlib.select`` などが使う)。 番号 ``[0, 1, 2, 5, 3]`` は ``vtx[0:2]``・``vtx[5]``・``vtx[3]`` になり、 番号をソートせず、保持順で+1ずつ連続する区間だけをまとめる。 全番号の再検証はまとめて1回だけ行う。"
msgstr "For passing many elements to ``maya.cmds`` (used by ``mlib.select``, for example). Indices ``[0, 1, 2, 5, 3]`` become ``vtx[0:2]``, ``vtx[5]``, and ``vtx[3]``. Indices are not sorted; only runs that increase by one in stored order are combined. All indices are revalidated together once."

msgid "``|cube|cubeShape.vtx[0:2]`` のような名前。空のコレクションは空リスト。"
msgstr "Names such as ``|cube|cubeShape.vtx[0:2]``. An empty collection is an empty list."

msgid "いずれかの番号が範囲外の場合。"
msgstr "If any number is out of range."

msgid "全番号の再検証はまとめて1回だけ行う。"
msgstr "All serial numbers are re-verified in a single batch check."

