msgstr "Element-level names such as ``|cube|cubeShape.vtx[3]``."

msgid "全番号を参照できればTrue。空集合も生存する対応シェイプならTrue。"
msgstr "True if all indices can be referenced. An empty collection is also True when its compatible shape is alive."

