msgstr "Normal updates convert to the UI distance unit and use cmds.xform. Fast updates first check input history, periodic curves, and locks and input connections on the Shape and target points. Preserve CV w."

msgid "有限なXYZ（cm）。"
msgstr "Finite XYZ coordinates in cm."

msgid "Trueは保持DAGパスのworld、既定FalseはShapeのobject空間。短縮名ws。"
msgstr "True uses world space for the retained DAG path; the default False uses Shape object space. Short name: ws."

msgid "TrueはUndoなし。既定FalseはUndo有効時に記録する。Undo設定は変更しない。"
msgstr "True updates without Undo. The default False records changes when Undo is enabled. Do not change Undo settings."

msgid "自身。共有Shapeの編集は全インスタンスへ影響する。"
msgstr "Self. Editing a shared Shape affects all its instances."

msgid "座標・空間が不正、または必要なworld逆変換が特異な場合。"
msgstr "If coordinates or space are invalid, or a required world inverse transform is singular."

msgid "fastがbool以外、または長短名を同時指定した場合。"
msgstr "If fast is not a bool, or both long and short names are specified."

msgid "番号が現在の範囲外の場合。"
msgstr "If the index is outside the current bounds."

msgid "対象が無効・書込み不可、またはMayaが更新を拒否した場合。"
msgstr "If the target is invalid or not writable, or Maya refuses the update."

msgid "fastで入力履歴付きShapeまたは周期カーブを編集する場合。"
msgstr "If a fast edit targets a Shape with input history or a periodic curve."

msgid "通常Meshのworld更新はcmdsへ委ね、独自の特異行列判定は行わない。 書込み中の失敗で完了済みの変更は自動で戻さない。"
msgstr "Normal Mesh world-space updates are delegated to cmds without a separate singular-matrix check. Completed changes are not restored automatically if a write fails."

msgid "有限な座標。"
msgstr "Finite coordinates."

msgid "TrueはOpenMaya直接更新（Undoなし）。既定False。"
msgstr "True means direct OpenMaya update (no Undo). Default is False."

msgid "更新した自身。"
msgstr "Updated by oneself."

msgid "座標・空間指定または要素数が不正な場合。"
msgstr "Invalid coordinate, space specification, or element count."

msgid "fastがboolでない場合。"
msgstr "when fast is not bool"

msgid "対象が無効、またはMayaが更新を拒否した場合。"
msgstr "The target is invalid or Maya rejected the update."

msgid "fast更新で未対応の形状の場合。"
msgstr "In case of shapes that are not supported by fast update."

