msgstr "Dispatch only Object calls by reference type, and construct derived classes normally."

msgid "Objectが解決したNode・Plug・Componentへ、再び初期化を行わない。"
msgstr "Do not initialize the Node, Plug, or Component resolved by Object a second time."

msgid "Objectでは単一の参照入力。派生クラスではその構築に渡す位置引数。"
msgstr "A single reference input for Object, or positional arguments for constructing a derived class."

msgid "参照の入力解決、または派生クラスの構築に渡すキーワード引数。"
msgstr "Keyword arguments passed to reference resolution or to construction of a derived class."

msgid "解決した参照、または構築した派生クラスのインスタンス。"
msgstr "The resolved reference, or an instance of the constructed derived class."

