msgstr "Initialize the fallback class and empty node type mapping table."

msgid ":py:obj:`_node_type_for_class <mlib.core.registry.NodeRegistry._node_type_for_class>`\\ \\(wrapper\\_class\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "現在の登録表で具体クラスに一意に対応するnodeTypeを取得する。"
msgstr "Get the nodeType uniquely mapped to the concrete class in the current registry."

msgid ":py:obj:`_restore <mlib.core.registry.NodeRegistry._restore>`\\ \\(snapshot\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "登録中の障害で、検証済みの保存状態を再登録せずに復元する。"
msgstr "Restore a validated snapshot after registration fails, without registering entries again."

msgid ":py:obj:`_snapshot <mlib.core.registry.NodeRegistry._snapshot>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "拡張の登録開始前に、現在の型対応を独立したコピーで保持する。"
msgstr "Copy the current type mappings before an extension begins registration."

msgid ":py:obj:`_validate_entry <mlib.core.registry.NodeRegistry._validate_entry>`\\ \\(node\\_type\\, wrapper\\_class\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "汎用登録の型名とクラスを検証する。既存キーの上書きは拒否しない。"
msgstr "Validate a type name and class for general registration, allowing existing keys to be replaced."

msgid ":py:obj:`clear <mlib.core.registry.NodeRegistry.clear>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ""

