msgid "mlib.maths"
msgstr "mlib.maths"

msgid "mlib の数学型と変換演算を公開する。"
msgstr "Expose the math types and conversion operations of mlib."

msgid "Vector 系・Quaternion・EulerRotate・Matrix は OpenMaya API 2.0 (``maya.api.OpenMaya``)の MVector / MQuaternion / MEulerRotation / MMatrix を 継承した可変の値型で、そのまま om2 の関数へ渡せる。演算は om2 の意味論に従う。 easing だけは標準ライブラリの math のみを使う純粋な関数群。"
msgstr "Vector, Quaternion, EulerRotate, and Matrix are mutable value types that inherit from OpenMaya API 2.0's MVector / MQuaternion / MEulerRotation / MMatrix (``maya.api.OpenMaya``), and can be passed directly to om2 functions. Operations follow the semantics of om2. The easing functions are pure function groups that use only the standard library's math module."

msgid "class mlib.maths.matrix.Matrix"
msgstr "class mlib.maths.matrix.Matrix"

msgid "ベースクラス: :py:obj:`maya.api.OpenMaya.MMatrix`"
msgstr "Base class: :py:obj:`maya.api.OpenMaya.MMatrix`"

msgid "om2.MMatrixを継承した、Mayaの行ベクトル規約の可変な4行4列行列。"
msgstr "A mutable om2.MMatrix subclass representing a 4-by-4 matrix with Maya's row-vector convention."

msgid "OpenMaya APIへそのまま渡せる。入力はコピーし、16要素は行優先、平行移動は添字12〜14。 Mayaへ渡す平行移動はcmで、UI単位へ換算しない。 合成・分解はアフィン変換を想定する。分解はMTransformationMatrixの規約で、 負の行列式ではZスケールを負にして180度の補償回転を入れる(cmds.xform/decomposeMatrixと同じ)。"
msgstr "Can be passed directly to OpenMaya APIs. Copy inputs; the 16 elements are row-major, with translation at indices 12-14. Translation passed to Maya is in cm without UI-unit conversion. Composition and decomposition assume affine transforms. Decomposition follows MTransformationMatrix; a negative determinant produces negative Z scale with a compensating 180-degree rotation, as with cmds.xform/decomposeMatrix."

msgid "``a * b`` / ``a @ b`` はaを先に適用する行列積。結果は ``type(a)``。 ``om2.MMatrix * Matrix`` もMatrixを返す。"
msgstr "``a * b`` / ``a @ b`` multiply matrices with a applied first. The result is ``type(a)``. ``om2.MMatrix * Matrix`` also returns Matrix."

msgid "数値倍・加減算はOM2の成分ごとの演算。"
msgstr "Scalar multiplication, addition and subtraction are OM2 componentwise operations."

msgid "``Vector * m`` は平行移動を含まない方向変換。 左辺が ``om2.MVector`` / ``om2.MPoint`` ならOM2側で処理しOM2型を返す。"
msgstr "``Vector * m`` transforms a direction without translation. If the left operand is ``om2.MVector`` / ``om2.MPoint``, OM2 handles the operation and returns an OM2 type."

msgid "``m * v`` はMVector系との列ベクトルの積(``v * mᵀ``)をVectorで返す。 ``m * om2.MPoint`` も列ベクトルの積のXYZをVectorで返し、結果のwは捨ててwで割らない。"
msgstr "``m * v`` returns a column-vector product with MVector types (``v * mᵀ``) as Vector. ``m * om2.MPoint`` also returns the XYZ of the column-vector product as Vector, discarding the resulting w without dividing by it."

msgid "``m @ v`` はTypeError。位置の変換は :meth:`transformPoint` または ``om2.MPoint(p) * m`` を使う。"
msgstr "``m @ v`` raises TypeError. To transform positions, use :meth:`transformPoint` or ``om2.MPoint(p) * m``."

msgid "``*=`` / ``@=`` / ``+=`` / ``-=`` は自身を更新する。数学値を返す継承メソッドもmlib型を返し、 コピー操作は独立値、It付き操作は自身更新となる。成分プロパティの取得値も独立した複製で、編集しても行列は変わらない。"
msgstr "``*=`` / ``@=`` / ``+=`` / ``-=`` update self. Inherited methods returning mathematical values also return mlib types. Copy operations return independent values; operations with It update self. Retrieved component properties are also independent copies; editing them does not change the matrix."

msgid "ハッシュ不可。``m[i]`` は-16〜15、``m[行, 列]`` は各-4〜3で代入でき、範囲外はIndexError。 ``==`` はMMatrix系の完全一致。異種型との比較は :class:`~mlib.maths.vector.Vector` と同じ扱い。"
msgstr "Unhashable. ``m[i]`` accepts -16 to 15, and ``m[行, 列]`` accepts -4 to 3 for each index, including assignment; out-of-range indices raise IndexError. ``==`` compares MMatrix types exactly. Comparisons with other types follow :class:`~mlib.maths.vector.Vector`."

