msgstr ":py:obj:`_xyz <mlib.maths.matrix._xyz>`\\ \\(value\\)"

msgid "3成分の値を (x, y, z) の tuple として取り出す。"
msgstr "Extract the 3-component value as a tuple (x, y, z)."

msgid "単位行列を -0.0 倍した「すべて -0.0」の行列へ source を加算する。-0.0 は加算の 単位元なので、符号付きゼロ・inf・NaN を含めて source と同じ値になる(0.0 を 使うと -0.0 が 0.0 になる)。"
msgstr "Add the source to a matrix that is the unit matrix multiplied by -0.0, resulting in a \"all -0.0\" matrix. Since -0.0 is the identity element for addition, the result will have the same values as the source, including signed zeros, infinities, and NaNs (using 0.0 would convert -0.0 to 0.0)."

