msgid "ベースクラス: :py:obj:`maya.api.OpenMaya.MVector`"
msgstr "Base class: :py:obj:`maya.api.OpenMaya.MVector`"

msgid "om2.MVectorを継承した、可変・ハッシュ不可のXYZベクトル値。"
msgstr "A mutable, unhashable XYZ vector value subclass of om2.MVector."

msgid "OpenMaya APIへそのまま渡せる。生成時は成分をコピーし、引数形式は :meth:`__init__` に従う。 MPointからもwで割らずXYZを写す。"
msgstr "Can be passed directly to OpenMaya APIs. Copy components on construction; argument forms follow :meth:`__init__`. Also copy XYZ from MPoint without dividing by w."

msgid "演算はOM2に従い、ベクトル結果は派生型によらず基底Vectorを返す。 ``om2.MVector`` が左辺の ``+`` / ``-`` / ``^`` もVectorになる。"
msgstr "Operations follow OM2; vector results return the base Vector regardless of the derived type. ``+`` / ``-`` / ``^`` also return Vector when ``om2.MVector`` is the left operand."

msgid "``+`` / ``-`` はMVector系の成分ごとの加減算。"
msgstr "``+`` / ``-`` perform componentwise addition and subtraction with MVector types."

msgid "``v * 数値`` / ``数値 * v`` / ``v / 数値`` はスカラー演算。0除算はZeroDivisionError。"
msgstr "``v * 数値`` / ``数値 * v`` / ``v / 数値`` perform scalar operations. Division by zero raises ZeroDivisionError."

msgid "``v * w`` は内積(float)、``v ^ w`` は外積。"
msgstr "``v * w`` is a dot product (float); ``v ^ w`` is a cross product."

msgid "``v * m`` は平行移動を含まない行ベクトルの方向変換。 ``m * v`` は列ベクトルの積(``v * mᵀ``)。"
msgstr "``v * m`` transforms a row-vector direction without translation. ``m * v`` is a column-vector product (``v * mᵀ``)."

msgid "``+=`` / ``-=`` / ``*=`` / ``/=`` / ``^=`` は自身を更新し派生型を保つ。 ただし ``v *= w`` は内積のfloatへ束ね直す。コピーを返す操作と自身更新を区別し、 数学値を返す継承メソッドも対応するmlib型を使う。OpenMayaの共有クラス定数は変更しない。"
msgstr "``+=`` / ``-=`` / ``*=`` / ``/=`` / ``^=`` update self and retain the derived type, except that ``v *= w`` rebinds to the dot-product float. Distinguish copy-returning operations from in-place updates. Inherited methods returning mathematical values also use corresponding mlib types. Do not modify OpenMaya's shared class constants."

msgid "成分・添字へ代入可能。添字は-3〜2、範囲外はIndexError。スライスは代入不可のtuple、反復はXYZ順。 ``==`` はMVector系の成分の完全一致で、派生型が違っても等しくなり得る。 それ以外はOM2型ならFalse、他は相手の比較へ委ね、未判定ならFalse。 OM2型が左辺の比較はOM2側でTypeErrorになり得る。"
msgstr "Components and indexed elements are assignable. Indices range from -3 to 2, with IndexError outside that range. Slices are nonassignable tuples; iteration is XYZ order. ``==`` compares components of MVector types exactly; different derived types may be equal. For other types, return False for OM2 types; otherwise defer to the other operand, returning False if unresolved. Comparison with an OM2 type on the left may raise TypeError in OM2."

