msgstr "Returns the angle in radians formed with another vector."

msgid ":py:obj:`cross <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.cross>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`cross <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.cross>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "外積を返す。"
msgstr "Returns the cross product."

msgid ":py:obj:`distanceTo <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.distanceTo>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`distanceTo <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.distanceTo>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "2点間のユークリッド距離を返す。"
msgstr "Returns the Euclidean distance between two points."

msgid ":py:obj:`dot <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.dot>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`dot <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.dot>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "内積を返す。"
msgstr "Returns the dot product."

msgid ":py:obj:`fromIterable <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.fromIterable>`\\ \\(values\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`fromIterable <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.fromIterable>`\\ \\(values\\)"

msgid ":py:obj:`isEquivalent <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.isEquivalent>`\\ \\(other\\[\\, tolerance\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid ":py:obj:`lengthSq <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.lengthSq>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`lengthSq <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.lengthSq>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "長さの2乗(自身との内積)を返す。"
msgstr "Returns the square of the length (the dot product with itself)."

msgid ":py:obj:`lerp <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.lerp>`\\ \\(other\\, t\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`lerp <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.lerp>`\\ \\(other\\, t\\)"

msgid "別のベクトルとの線形補間 ``self + (other - self) * t`` を返す。"
msgstr "Returns linearly interpolated vector with another vector ``self + (other - self) * t``."

msgid ":py:obj:`mirror <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.mirror>`\\ \\(\\[axis\\, pivot\\]\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`mirror <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.mirror>`\\ \\(\\[axis\\, pivot\\]\\)"

msgid "指定中心から成分を反転した同型の複製を返す。"
msgstr "Returns a duplicated isomorphic object with components inverted from the specified center."

msgid ":py:obj:`mirrorIt <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.mirrorIt>`\\ \\(\\[axis\\, pivot\\]\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`mirrorIt <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.mirrorIt>`\\ \\(\\[axis\\, pivot\\]\\)"

msgid "自身の3成分を反転する。"
msgstr "Invert its own three components."

msgid ":py:obj:`normal <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.normal>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`normal <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.normal>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "OpenMayaの規則で正規化したVectorの複製を返す。"
msgstr "Return a copy of the Vector normalized under OpenMaya's rules."

msgid ":py:obj:`rotateBy <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.rotateBy>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`rotateBy <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.rotateBy>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "OpenMayaの回転規則でXYZベクトルを回し、独立したVectorを返す。"
msgstr "Rotate an XYZ vector according to OpenMaya's rotation rules and return an independent Vector."

msgid ":py:obj:`rotateTo <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.rotateTo>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`rotateTo <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.rotateTo>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "自身の方向から指定した方向へ向けるQuaternionを返す。"
msgstr "Return the Quaternion rotating self's direction toward the specified direction."

msgid ":py:obj:`transformAsNormal <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.transformAsNormal>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`transformAsNormal <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.transformAsNormal>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "行列の逆転置で法線変換し、正規化したVectorの複製を返す。"
msgstr "Transform a normal with the matrix's inverse transpose and return a normalized Vector copy."

msgid ":py:obj:`unit <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.unit>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`unit <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.unit>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "正規化した新しいベクトルを返す。"
msgstr "Returns a normalized new vector."

msgid ":py:obj:`unitIt <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.unitIt>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`unitIt <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.unitIt>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "加算する MVector 系。"
msgstr "Additive MVector types."

msgid "新しい Vector。対応しない型は NotImplemented。"
msgstr "New Vector. NotImplemented for unsupported types."

msgid "MVector 系なら om2 と同じ成分比較の結果。 その他の om2 の型は False。それ以外の型は NotImplemented(相手の比較に委ね、 どちらも判断しなければ False になる)。"
msgstr "If the other operand is of the MVector family, the result is the same as comparing the components with om2. For other om2 types, it returns False. For all other types, it returns NotImplemented (delegates to the other object's comparison; if neither can evaluate, it defaults to False)."

msgid "-3〜2 の添字、またはスライス。"
msgstr "-3 to 2 indices, or slices."

msgid "om2 の MVector を継承した型では、対応しない型との ``+=`` が例外にならず NotImplemented が代入されてしまうため、型を検査してから委譲する。"
msgstr "In types inheriting from the OM2 MVector, the ``+=`` methods do not raise an exception when dealing with unsupported types, but instead assign ``NotImplemented``. Therefore, type checking must be performed before delegation."

msgid "自身。対応しない型は NotImplemented(TypeError になる)。"
msgstr "Self. Types that do not correspond will result in NotImplemented (which raises a TypeError)."

msgid "数値または MMatrix 系。"
msgstr "Numeric or MMatrix type."

msgid "自身。対応しない型は NotImplemented (MVector 系を渡した場合は om2 と同じく内積へ戻り、名前が float に再束縛される)。"
msgstr "Self. For unsupported types, return NotImplemented (when passing MVector types, similar to om2, it returns to dot product, and the name is rebound to float)."

msgid "``()``、``(x, y, z)``、``(x, y)``、``(values)``、または ``(MVector | MPoint | MFloatVector | MFloatPoint)`` など om2 の MVector のコンストラクタが受け付ける引数。"
msgstr "Arguments that om2 MVector constructors accept, such as ``()``, ``(x, y, z)``, ``(x, y)``, ``(values)``, or ``(MVector | MPoint | MFloatVector | MFloatPoint)``."

msgid "``x``、``y``、``z``。位置引数と合わせて使える。省略した成分は 0。"
msgstr "``x``, ``y``, ``z``. Can be used with positional arguments. Omitted components are set to 0."

msgid "om2 のコンストラクタが受け付けない引数(文字列の成分など)の場合。"
msgstr "When the om2 constructor does not accept arguments such as string components."

msgid "減算する MVector 系。"
msgstr "Subtracting MVector type."

msgid "3成分のイテレータ。"
msgstr "3-component iterator."

msgid "外積の相手となる MVector 系。"
msgstr "MVector type operands for cross product."

msgid "数値、MVector 系、または MMatrix 系。"
msgstr "Numeric, MVector, or MMatrix."

msgid "数値ならスカラー倍の Vector、 MVector 系なら内積の float、MMatrix 系なら行ベクトル規約で方向変換した Vector(平行移動を含まない)。対応しない型は NotImplemented。"
msgstr "If the operand is a number, the result is a scalar-multiplied Vector; if it is an MVector, the result is a float representing the dot product; if it is an MMatrix, the result is a Vector transformed by the row-vector convention (without translation). NotImplemented is returned for unsupported types."

msgid "MVector 系なら om2 と同じ比較の結果。 その他の om2 の型は True。それ以外の型は NotImplemented。"
msgstr "If the type is MVector or similar, the comparison result is the same as om2. Other om2 types return True. Other types return NotImplemented."

msgid "新しい Vector。派生クラスの型は保持しない。"
msgstr "New Vector. Derived class types are not preserved."

msgid "``__init__`` を省略・失敗した派生クラスでも未確保実体へアクセスしないため、ここで確保する。 mlibの ``__init__`` は成分だけを設定する。基底初期化の再実行はMaya 2022で実体をリークする。"
msgstr "Allocate here to avoid accessing an unallocated instance even in derived classes that skip or fail ``__init__``. mlib's ``__init__`` only sets components. Repeating base initialization leaks the instance in Maya 2022."

msgid "clsのゼロベクトル。"
msgstr "A zero vector of cls."

msgid "左辺の MVector 系。"
msgstr "Left-hand side MVector family."

msgid "om2 の型は C++ の実体を基底の ``__init__`` で確保するため、再構築関数で 確保してから成分を設定する。利用者の派生クラスの ``__init__`` は呼ばず、 ``__dict__`` と ``__slots__`` のアトリビュートは再構築時に復元する。"
msgstr "The om2 types allocate the underlying C++ entities using the base ``__init__``, so in the rebuild function, memory is allocated first and then components are set. The user's derived class ``__init__`` is not called; instead, the ``__dict__`` and ``__slots__`` attributes are restored during reconstruction."

msgid "``(_rebuild, (type(self), (x, y, z))[, state])``。"
msgstr "``(_rebuild, (type(self), (x, y, z))[, state])``"

msgid "``Translate(1.0, 2.0, 3.0)`` の形式の文字列。"
msgstr "A string in the form of ``Translate(1.0, 2.0, 3.0)``."

msgid "``m * v`` (m は MMatrix 系)は om2 と同じく列ベクトルとしての積 (``v * mᵀ``)になる。位置を行列で変換する場合は :meth:`mlib.maths.matrix.Matrix.transformPoint`、方向は ``v * m`` を使う。"
msgstr "``m * v`` (where m is a MMatrix type) is the same as om2 in that it uses column-vector style multiplication (``v * mᵀ``). To transform positions with a matrix, use :meth:`mlib.maths.matrix.Matrix.transformPoint`, and for directions, use ``v * m``."

msgid "Vector は om2.MVector の派生なので、``om2.MVector ^ Vector`` では Python が このメソッドを先に呼ぶ(定義しないと om2 の結果の ``om2.MVector`` になる)。"
msgstr "Vector is derived from om2.MVector, so in ``om2.MVector ^ Vector``, Python calls this method first (if not defined, it will result in om2's ``om2.MVector``)."

msgid "other が 0 の場合(Maya のバージョンにかかわらない)。"
msgstr "When other is 0 (regardless of Maya version)."

msgid "利用者の派生クラスの ``__init__`` は呼ばない。"
msgstr "Do not call the user's derived class ``__init__``."

msgid "``atan2(|a × b|, a · b)`` で計算するため、ほぼ平行・反平行な場合も精度を 保つ(om2 の ``angle()`` は約 1e-5 rad 未満の角度を 0 として返す)。"
msgstr "Because calculations are performed using ``atan2(|a × b|, a · b)``, accuracy is maintained even in cases that are nearly parallel or antiparallel (om2's ``angle()`` returns angles less than approximately 1e-5 rad as 0)."

msgid "角度を測る相手。"
msgstr "The object to measure the angle against."

msgid "自身または other がゼロベクトルの場合。"
msgstr "When self or other is a zero vector."

msgid "外積の相手。"
msgstr "Cross product operand."

msgid "外積。派生クラスの型は保持しない。"
msgstr "Cross product. Derived class types are not preserved."

msgid "距離を測る相手。"
msgstr "The object to measure the distance to."

msgid "距離。"
msgstr "Distance."

msgid "内積の相手。"
msgstr "Dot product opponent."

msgid "3要素の反復可能オブジェクト。"
msgstr "3-element iterable object."

msgid "要素数が3でない場合。"
msgstr "When the number of elements is not three."

msgid "om2 の ``isEquivalent`` に委譲するため、2点間のユークリッド距離が tolerance 以下かどうかで判定する。"
msgstr "Delegates to om2 ``isEquivalent`` and tests whether the Euclidean distance between the two points is at most tolerance."

msgid "距離の許容誤差。"
msgstr "Tolerance error for distance."

msgid "平方根を計算しないため、長さの比較だけが目的なら length() より速い。"
msgstr "Because it does not compute square roots, length() is faster than using the length for comparisons only."

msgid "長さの2乗。"
msgstr "Squared length."

msgid "補間先。"
msgstr "Target interpolation."

msgid "補間係数。0 で自身、1 で other。範囲外は外挿になる。"
msgstr "Interpolation coefficient. 0 means self, 1 means other. Values outside the range will result in extrapolation."

msgid "補間結果。派生クラスの型は保持しない。"
msgstr "Interpolation result. Derived class types are not preserved."

msgid "Translate・Scale・Shearでも数値反転として使用できる。 Scale・Shearの行列としての鏡映にはMatrix.mirrorを使う。"
msgstr "Also supports numeric reflection for Translate, Scale, and Shear. Use Matrix.mirror for matrix-based reflection of Scale and Shear."

msgid "値と同じ単位の中心。方向には原点を使う。"
msgstr "Center with the same units as the value. Use the origin for the direction."

msgid "同型の新しい値。"
msgstr "Same type new value."

msgid "値と同じ単位の中心。"
msgstr "Center with the same unit as the value."

msgid "MVector.rotateBy()へ引数をそのまま渡し、自身や回転引数は変更しない。 Quaternionの事前正規化やゼロ拒否を独自に加えないため、 Quaternion.rotateVector()の正規化コピーによる回転とは入力条件が異なる。"
msgstr "Pass arguments unchanged to MVector.rotateBy(), without modifying self or the rotation argument. Do not add custom Quaternion prenormalization or zero rejection, so the accepted input conditions differ from Quaternion.rotateVector(), which rotates using a normalized copy."

msgid "Quaternion/EulerRotateなどの回転、またはOpenMayaの軸定数とrad角度。 多重定義の受理型はMVector.rotateBy()に従う。"
msgstr "A rotation such as Quaternion/EulerRotate, or an OpenMaya axis constant and an angle in rad. Accepted overload argument types follow MVector.rotateBy()."

msgid "基底Vectorの新しい値。派生型や追加Python状態は引き継がない。"
msgstr "A new base Vector value. Do not preserve the subclass or additional Python state."

msgid "目標方向となるMVector系のtargetを指定する。"
msgstr "Specify an MVector-family target direction."

msgid "変換に使うMMatrix系のmatrixを指定する。"
msgstr "Specify an MMatrix-family matrix for the transformation."

msgid "om2 の ``normal()`` はゼロベクトルでも例外にならず ``om2.MVector`` を返すが、 このメソッドは mlib の Vector を返し、ゼロベクトルを拒否する。"
msgstr "The om2 ``normal()`` does not raise an exception even for zero vectors, and returns ``om2.MVector``, but this method returns an mlib Vector and rejects zero vectors."

msgid "長さ 1 のベクトル。派生クラスの型は保持しない。"
msgstr "A vector of length 1. The type of the derived class is not preserved."

msgid "ゼロベクトルの場合。"
msgstr "In the case of a zero vector."

msgid ":py:obj:`__hash__ <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.__hash__>`\\"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__hash__ <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.__hash__>`\\"

msgid ":py:obj:`__slots__ <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.__slots__>`\\"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__slots__ <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.__slots__>`\\"

msgid ":py:obj:`__str__ <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.__str__>`\\"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__str__ <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.__str__>`\\"

msgid ":py:obj:`x <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.x>`\\"
msgstr ":py:obj:`x <mlib.maths.vector.Vector.x>`\\"

