msgstr "class mlib.nodes.blinn.Blinn"

msgid "ベースクラス: :py:obj:`mlib.nodes.reflect.Reflect`"
msgstr "Base class: :py:obj:`mlib.nodes.reflect.Reflect`"

msgid "Mayaの継承型に対応するBlinn。値と接続はPlugで操作する。"
msgstr "Blinn that supports Maya's inheritance type. Values and connections are manipulated through plugs."

msgid "mlib.nodes.blinn"
msgstr "mlib.nodes.blinn"

msgid "Mayaのblinnノードを扱う。"
msgstr "Handling Maya's blinn node."

msgid ":py:obj:`Blinn <mlib.nodes.blinn.Blinn>`\\"
