msgstr "Get MFnCamera."

msgid ":py:obj:`getFocalLength <mlib.nodes.camera.Camera.getFocalLength>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`getFocalLength <mlib.nodes.camera.Camera.getFocalLength>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "焦点距離を取得する。"
msgstr "Get the focal length."

msgid "この camera の function set。"
msgstr "This camera's function set."

msgid "Maya の焦点距離。"
