msgstr "allDescendents, leaves, includeSelf, or underWorld is not a bool."

msgid "探索順が不正、またはleavesとshapesを併用した場合。"
msgstr "When the traversal order is invalid or leaves and shapes are combined."

msgid "ノードは有効だが保持するDAGパスが無効な場合。"
