msgstr "Alias for idx. Do not specify both names together."

msgid "Shapeなら自身、それ以外はNone。"
msgstr "If Shape, then self; otherwise None."

msgid "idxとindexを同時指定した場合。"
msgstr "If idx and index are specified together."

