msgstr "For a Shape, examine self; for a Transform, examine its direct non-intermediate Shapes. Do not search below child Transforms. After traversing upstream, return only deformers whose output Shape matches the target, excluding unrelated shapes' history. Works across Mesh, NURBS, and other shapes without changing the scene or Undo history. Joint's method of the same name preserves its existing influence-connection query."

msgid "Shape順、各Shapeの上流幅優先順。重複なし。     対象なしは空リスト。"
msgstr "In Shape order, then upstream breadth-first order for each Shape, without duplicates. An empty list if none match."

msgid "Shape順、各Shapeの上流幅優先順。重複なし。"
msgstr "In Shape order, then upstream breadth-first order for each Shape, without duplicates."

msgid "対象なしは空リスト。"
msgstr "An empty list if none match."

msgid "無効なDAGパス、またはMayaの検索が失敗した場合。"
msgstr "When the DAG path is invalid or Maya's search fails."

