msgstr "Copy it with ``om2.MDagPath(node.mpath())`` before push/pop or other edits."

msgid "内部で保持するインスタンスのパスと同一のオブジェクト。"
msgstr "The same object as the internally retained instance path."

msgid "保持パスが無効な場合。別インスタンスへ切り替えない。"
msgstr "If the retained path is invalid. Do not switch to another instance."

