msgstr "True to show, False to hide (inverted setting of hiddenInOutliner)."

msgid "自身。DagNodes・Transforms・Jointsからの一括操作にも対応する。"
msgstr "Self. Also supports batch operations from DagNodes, Transforms, and Joints."

msgid "stateまたはfastがboolでない場合。"
msgstr "when state or fast is not bool."

msgid "対応アトリビュートがない場合。"
msgstr "No corresponding attribute."

msgid "ロック・入力接続などで更新できない場合。"
msgstr "When you cannot update due to locked input connections or the like."

msgid "ビューポートのvisibilityは変更しない。表示の最終結果は各Outlinerの フィルターや非表示ノード表示設定にも依存する。"
msgstr "Do not change the visibility of the viewport. The final display result also depends on the filters and hidden node display settings in each Outliner."

msgid "visibilityへ設定する値。"
msgstr "Value to set for visibility."

msgid "``fast=True`` はOpenMaya直接更新（Undoなし）。既定の ``False`` は通常処理。 fastがbool以外ならTypeError。完了済みの直接更新は自動で戻さない。"
msgstr "``fast=True`` updates OpenMaya directly without undo. The default ``False`` is normal processing. A TypeError occurs if fast is not a bool. Direct updates that are already completed are not automatically reverted."

