msgstr "Get the IK handle with itself as the start joint."

msgid ":py:obj:`getInverseScale <mlib.nodes.joint.Joint.getInverseScale>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`getInverseScale <mlib.nodes.joint.Joint.getInverseScale>`\\ \\(\\)"

