msgstr "Retrieve the dimensionless XYZ inverseScale values as an independent Scale."

msgid ":py:obj:`getJointOrient <mlib.nodes.joint.Joint.getJointOrient>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`getJointOrient <mlib.nodes.joint.Joint.getJointOrient>`\\ \\(\\)"

