msgid "共有Shapeの全インスタンスへ影響する。複製・結合・片側からの対称化・法線反転は行わない。 奇数軸の反転で面の向きが変わる場合、必要な法線処理は別途行う。"
msgstr "Affect all instances of the shared Shape. Do not duplicate, merge, copy symmetry from one side, or reverse normals. If reflecting an odd number of axes changes face orientation, handle normals separately as needed."

msgid "Trueは保持パスのworld、既定FalseはShapeのobject空間。短縮名ws。"
msgstr "True uses world space for the retained path; the default False uses Shape object space. Short name: ws."

msgid "指定空間の反転中心XYZ（cm）。既定は原点で、Transformのピボットとは独立。"
msgstr "The reflection center XYZ in cm in the specified space. Default: the origin, independently of the Transform pivot."

msgid "頂点番号。Noneは全頂点、空列は変更なし。重複は1回だけ処理する。"
msgstr "Vertex indices. None selects all vertices; an empty sequence changes nothing. Process duplicates only once."

msgid "TrueはUndoなし。既定FalseはUndo有効時に1回で戻せる通常更新。"
msgstr "True updates without Undo. The default False uses normal updates that can be undone once when Undo is enabled."

msgid "自身。頂点番号・面の接続と頂点順は保持する。"
msgstr "Self. Preserve vertex indices, face connectivity and vertex order."

msgid "番号型・fastが不正、または長短名を同時指定した場合。"
msgstr "If an index type or fast is invalid, or both long and short names are specified."

msgid "頂点番号が負または範囲外の場合。"
msgstr "If a vertex index is negative or out of range."

msgid "Mayaが形状の取得・更新を拒否した場合。"
msgstr "If Maya refuses to read or update the geometry."

msgid "fastで入力履歴付きShapeを編集する場合。"
msgstr "If fast edits a Shape with input history."

msgid "途中失敗で完了済みの変更は自動で戻さない。"
msgstr "Completed changes are not restored automatically after a later failure."

msgid "頂点位置・面順/向き・UV・法線・面マテリアルは保持する。エッジ番号は変わり得る。 スキン等の番号依存データは移し替えず、既存Component参照は処理後に取り直す。 UVシームは各頂点の面頂点UV群で照合し、曖昧な対応は変更前に拒否する。"
msgstr "Preserve vertex positions, face order and orientation, UVs, normals and face materials. Edge indices may change. Do not remap index-dependent data such as skinning; reacquire existing Component references afterward. Compare UV seams using each vertex's face-vertex UV group, and reject ambiguous matches before changing the scene."

msgid "基準Meshまたは単一メッシュTransform。"
msgstr "A reference Mesh or a Transform with a single mesh."

msgid "UV照合のセット名。位置照合では使わない。"
msgstr "The UV set used for UV matching. Unused for position matching."

msgid "非負有限値。UVは成分差、位置はcm距離の許容誤差。"
msgstr "A nonnegative finite tolerance: component differences for UVs, or distances in cm for positions."

msgid "TrueはUndoなしで再構築し、非ゼロtweakを現在位置へベイクする。 既定FalseはUndo有効が必須で、非ゼロtweakは未対応。"
msgstr "True rebuilds without Undo and bakes nonzero tweaks into current positions. The default False requires Undo to be enabled and does not support nonzero tweaks."

msgid "既定uv、またはposition。"
msgstr "The default uv, or position."

msgid "位置照合でTrueはworld、既定Falseは各Shapeのobject空間。UV照合では使わない。"
msgstr "For position matching, True uses world space and the default False uses each Shape's object space. Unused for UV matching."

msgid "自身。番号対応が既に同一なら再構築せず返し、再構築用の制限検査にも進まない。"
msgstr "Self. Return without rebuilding if the index mapping is already identical, and skip rebuild restriction checks."

msgid "入力型・fast/worldSpaceが不正、または長短名を同時指定した場合。"
msgstr "If an input type or fast/worldSpace is invalid, or both long and short names are specified."

msgid "対応が曖昧/不完全、またはトポロジー/面の向きが一致しない場合。"
msgstr "If the correspondence is ambiguous or incomplete, or topology or face orientation does not match."

msgid "再構築時に入出力履歴・インスタンス・参照・色セット・クリース等がある場合。"
msgstr "If rebuilding encounters input/output history, instances, references, color sets, creases or similar restrictions."

msgid "再構築時にロック、または通常処理でUndoが無効の場合。"
msgstr "If rebuilding encounters locks, or normal processing has Undo disabled."

