msgstr "For other single-object method failures. Include the target index and do not execute later elements."

msgid "Trueなら各対象にsafe=Trueを渡し、DG接続を持つ対象を残す。"
msgstr "True passes safe=True to each target, retaining targets with DG connections."

msgid "空なら何もしない。Jointsも同じMaya標準削除を継承する。"
msgstr "Does nothing when empty. Joints inherits the same standard Maya deletion behavior."

msgid "実行前に削除済みの参照がある、または削除失敗。 途中までの変更は自動で戻さない。全体は一回のUndoで戻せる。"
msgstr "References that were deleted or failed to delete exist before execution. Changes made up to that point will not be automatically reverted. The entire change can be undone with a single Undo operation."

