msgid ":py:obj:`set <mlib.plugs.double3Plug.Double3Plug.set>`\\ \\(value\\[\\, safe\\, unit\\, uiUnits\\, fast\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "このアトリビュートの3成分だけを書き込む。行列経由の姿勢変更は行わない。"
msgstr "Write only this attribute's three components, without changing the pose through a matrix."

msgid "UI数値への数学型指定など、成分変換そのものの失敗では子を更新しない。"
msgstr "Children are not updated if component conversion itself fails, such as passing a math type as UI numeric values."

msgid "最初の設定へ渡した値。"
msgstr "The value passed to the initial assignment."

msgid "rotateの数値列の角度単位。"
msgstr "The angular unit of the numeric rotate sequence."

msgid "TrueならUI数値を内部単位へ一度変換する。"
msgstr "True converts UI numeric values to internal units once."

msgid "子のsetへ渡す更新経路。"
msgstr "The update path passed to each child's set method."

msgid "子の失敗数、または入力変換の失敗を表す1。"
msgstr "The number of failed child updates, or 1 for input conversion failure."

msgid "シーンへの書込みは行わない。rotate以外ではunitを解釈せず、有限な3成分を返す。"
msgstr "Does not write to the scene. For attributes other than rotate, returns three finite components without interpreting unit."

msgid "rotateの数値列はrad/deg。型付き回転ではradのみ。"
msgstr "rad/deg for numeric rotate components. Typed rotations accept only rad."

msgid "rotateはノードのrotateOrderに従うラジアンの成分。     それ以外は入力の3成分。回転以外の単位換算は呼出元が担当する。"
msgstr "For rotate, components in radians using the node's rotateOrder. Otherwise, the three input components. The caller handles unit conversion outside rotation."

msgid "rotateはノードのrotateOrderに従うラジアンの成分。"
msgstr "For rotate, components in radians using the node's rotateOrder."

msgid "それ以外は入力の3成分。回転以外の単位換算は呼出元が担当する。"
msgstr "Otherwise, the three input components. The caller handles unit conversion outside rotation."

msgid "値を数値列へ変換できない場合。"
msgstr "The value cannot be converted to numeric components."

msgid "成分数・有限値・角度単位が不正の場合。"
msgstr "The component count, finite values, or angle unit is invalid."

msgid "UI単位の数値3成分。"
msgstr "Three numeric components in UI units."

msgid "内部単位の数値3成分。"
msgstr "Three numeric components in internal units."

msgid "OpenMayaの数学値をUI数値として指定した場合。"
msgstr "If an OpenMaya math value is supplied as UI numeric input."

msgid "Trueは現在のUI単位の数値tuple。既定Falseは内部単位の数学値。"
msgstr "True returns a numeric tuple in the current UI units. The default False returns a math value in internal units."

msgid "translateはTranslate、rotateはノードのrotateOrderを持つEulerRotate、 scaleはScale、shearはShear、その他はVector。距離cm・角度radの独立した値。 uiUnits=Trueでは子の単位定義に従うtupleを返し、数学型は返さない。"
msgstr "translate returns Translate, rotate returns EulerRotate with the node's rotateOrder, scale returns Scale, shear returns Shear, and other attributes return Vector. These are independent values in centimeters and radians. With uiUnits=True, return a tuple using each child's unit definition, rather than a math type."

msgid "所有ノードまたはアトリビュートが無効な場合。"
msgstr "If the owning node or attribute is invalid."

msgid "3成分の入力と書込み可否を確認してCompoundPlug.setへ渡す。 safeの再試行では成功した子の更新を残す。通常処理はUndo有効時に記録し、fastは記録しない。"
msgstr "Check the three-component input and writability before calling CompoundPlug.set. Safe retries leave successful child updates in place. Normal operations record Undo when enabled; fast does not."

msgid "3成分の値。 rotateではOpenMaya基底型の回転も受理し、ノードのrotateOrderへ揃える。 数値列はノードのrotateOrderで解釈する。"
msgstr "A three-component value. For rotate, also accept rotations of the corresponding OpenMaya base types and reorder them to the node's rotateOrder. Interpret numeric sequences in the node's rotateOrder."

msgid "Trueは対応する書込み失敗を数える。"
msgstr "True counts supported write failures."

msgid "uiUnits=Falseではrotateの数値列にrad/degを使い、他のアトリビュートでは未使用。 型付き回転はradのみ。"
msgstr "With uiUnits=False, use rad/deg for numeric rotate sequences; unused for other attributes. Typed rotations accept rad only."

msgid "TrueはUI単位の数値列を指定する。数学型と既定rad以外のunitは受理しない。"
msgstr "True specifies a numeric sequence in UI units. Math types and unit values other than the default rad are not accepted."

msgid "safe=Falseは自身。safe=Trueは成功0、子の失敗数、または入力変換失敗の1。     CompoundPlug.setの再試行規則に従い、更新済みの値は自動では戻さない。"
msgstr "With safe=False, return self. With safe=True, return 0 on success, a child failure count, or 1 for input conversion failure. Follow CompoundPlug.set retry rules; completed updates are not restored automatically."

msgid "safe=Falseは自身。safe=Trueは成功0、子の失敗数、または入力変換失敗の1。"
msgstr "With safe=False, return self. With safe=True, return 0 on success, a child failure count, or 1 for input conversion failure."

msgid "CompoundPlug.setの再試行規則に従い、更新済みの値は自動では戻さない。"
msgstr "Follow CompoundPlug.set retry rules; completed updates are not restored automatically."

msgid "fastがbool以外、または配列全体への設定。safe=Trueでも抑制しない。 safe=Falseでは入力型が不正な場合も送出する。"
msgstr "If fast is not bool or the entire array is specified, even with safe=True. Also raised for invalid input types when safe=False."

msgid "fastで未対応の型の場合。safe=Trueでも抑制しない。"
msgstr "If the fast path does not support the type, even with safe=True."

msgid "safe=Falseで成分数・有限値・角度単位が不正な場合。"
msgstr "If safe=False and the component count, finite values, or angle unit is invalid."

msgid "safe=Falseで無効参照、ロック・入力接続、またはMayaの編集失敗。"
msgstr "If safe=False and the reference is invalid, an attribute is locked or connected, or Maya editing fails."

